  "evaluation_protocol": "identical to E6 \u2014 scripts/evaluation/run_three_mode_diagnostic.py, 150 prompts, mask d6e24e0b\u2026, greedy, context 8192, unrestricted (P18), no degeneration stop, no repair, no truncation, no synthetic terminals",
